- L. Breiman (2001). "Random forests". *Machine Learning* 45(1), 5–32. doi:10.1023/A:1010933404324
- L. Breiman, J. H. Friedman, R. A. Olshen and C. J. Stone (1984). *Classification and Regression Trees*. Wadsworth.
- C. Strobl, A.-L. Boulesteix, A. Zeileis and T. Hothorn (2007). "Bias in random forest variable importance measures: illustrations, sources and a solution". *BMC Bioinformatics* 8, 25. doi:10.1186/1471-2105-8-25
- T. Hastie, R. Tibshirani and J. Friedman (2009). *The Elements of Statistical Learning*, 2nd ed., chapter 15. Springer. doi:10.1007/978-0-387-84858-7
